              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 18:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omu biro ebyo omwe ahari bakaamwana ba baanabi akatakira Elisa, naagira ati: Omwiru waawe ibanye akafa; kandi noomanya ku omwiru waawe yaabaire atiina Ruhanga; kwonka orikwihuza aizire kutwara abaana bangye bombi kuba abahuuku be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisa yaamubuuza ati: Mbwenu nooyenda ku nkukorera ki? Ngambira eki otungire omuka. Onu ati: Omuzaana waawe taine ki atungire, kureka ecupa emwe y'amajuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisa yaagira ati: Irookooze omuri bangyenzi baawe boona, otiizemu ecupa ezirimu busha, kwona zitari nkye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima ogarukye omuka, oyekingirane na batabani baawe, oshukye ago majuta omuri ezo ecupa zoona; eraijure, ogibiikye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atyo yaamurugaho, yaayekingirana n'abatabani, baamureetera ecupa, yaazishukamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ecupa zoona ku zaaherize kwijura, yaagira omutabani ati: Ndeetera endiijo. Yaamugira ati: Tihakiriho ndiijo. Ahonaaho amajuta gaarekyeraho kwija. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaija yaagambira omushaija wa Ruhanga; nawe yaamugira ati: Irooko otunde ahari ago majuta, oihure amabanja gaawe; bwanyima iwe na batabani baawe mutungwe agaraatsigareho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
