              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 14:16-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.15.32+MAT.15.33+MAT.15.34+MAT.15.35+MAT.15.36+MAT.15.37+MAT.15.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15:32-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Haija omushaija naaruga Baali-shaliisha, areeteire omushaija wa Ruhanga eby'okurya by'omuganuro, emigaati ya sayiri makumi abiri n'enshaho y'obushiisha bubisi bw'engano. Elisa yaagira omuheereza we ati: Gaburira abantu, barye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka ogwo muheereza yaagira ati: Ebi nimbaasa nta kubigaburira abashaija igana? Elisa yaagaruka yaamugambira ati: Bigaburire abantu, barye; ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Nibaija kurya, batsigazeho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:44"
          },
          "items": [
